adius` key (written out, shorthand or computed; an exact allow-list of the embed CSS, react-pdf, the Chart.js bar and the OG route), Tailwind's parenthesis form `rounded-(--x)` is refused, and a `<Skeleton>` 40px or taller must name its surface's radius (the default corner is `--radius-sm`, for text bars).
 
